# The only image built here is the API server's, from services/api/Dockerfile.
# It takes the workspace manifests, the shared packages and the API's source;
# everything else, the map site and gigabytes of data among it, stays out of
# the build context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages
!services/api

**/node_modules
# The Atlas release is mounted when the container runs, never built in.
services/api/public
services/api/tests
